6          --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7             Author:    P. Chen
8             Notes from Author:
9               1. This is just a test version reference code, may need to be validated before using.
10              2. In many cases, one may wish to use LSEMAN instead of the MEAN, other produces
11                 (For example: PROC MIXED) could be used to calculate lsmeans in data step. The code for plot part
12                 should only require very minor changes.
13              3. A BANDPLOT statement can be added to the reference code to draw the shaded "Normal Range" area
14                 in the background based on your data and your requirement.
15         **eoh**********************************************************************************************/
16         options  NOCENTER MPRINT ;
17         
18         %* modification 2019-12-23 - update path as data has been moved;
19         
20         filename source "&rawadam./advs.xpt";
21         libname source xport ;
