336          /*** BOXPLOT for each PARAMETER and ANALYSIS TIMEPOINT in selected data
337        
338            One box plot for each PARAMETER and ANALYSIS TIMEPOINT.
339            By Visit and Treatment.
340        
341            In case of many visits and treatments, each box plot will use multiple pages.
342        
343            UTIL_PROC_TEMPLATE parameters:
344              TEMPLATE     Positional parameter, the name of the template to compile.
345              DESIGNWIDTH  Default is 260mm, suitable for one full-page landscape Letter/A4 plot.
346                           130mm is suitable for these 2 side-by-side plots.
347              DESIGNHEIGHT Default is 170mm, suitable for one full-page landscape Letter/A4 plot.
348        
349            BOXPLOT_EACH_PARAM_TP parameters:
350              CLEANUP      Default is 1, delete intermediate data sets.
351                           Set to 0 (zero) to preserve temp data sets from the final loop.
352        
353          ***/
354        
355            %util_proc_template(phuseboxplot)
